# Chapter 2's GIF: Typing a new task into the prompt, then toggling it done.
# Regenerate with:  python3 tools/scripts/record_media.py gifs --only 2

Output Sources/TerminalUI/TerminalUI.docc/Resources/demo-ch2.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 760
Set Height 460
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type ".build-recordings/tutorial/.build/release/tasks20301"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type@90ms "Feed the fox"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Down@300ms 3
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s

Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms
